    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadows of Teotihuacan</strong> is a first-person mystery adventure set in the awe-inspiring ruins of an ancient civilization. As a private detective, you're hired by a desperate woman to locate her missing husband, last contacted while exploring the enigmatic pyramids of Teotihuacan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542220/extras/e9b3eac60e3ea54bc211cd8afa9b0b2c.avif?t=1750182104\" width=736 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CURRENT FEATURES :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Teotihuacan\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Navigate faithfully recreated ruins, including major structures of the ancient site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong> \u2013 Experience the mystery up close through the eyes of a detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive Through the Ruins</strong> \u2013 Take the wheel of a drivable vehicle to cover vast distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn the Ropes</strong> \u2013 A guided tutorial introduces basic movement and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Early Access version contains</strong> ~1/4 of the game. Full game will add more areas, puzzles, and story content which will be released for 1.0 version.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542220/extras/9cd495cc2c93d8df909b2aa823837804.avif?t=1750182104\" width=736 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLANNED FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved character mechanics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integration of the remaining  content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passage of time mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save game system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadows of Teotihuacan</strong> is a first-person mystery adventure set in the awe-inspiring ruins of an ancient civilization. As a private detective, you're hired by a desperate woman to locate her missing husband, last contacted while exploring the enigmatic pyramids of Teotihuacan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542220/extras/e9b3eac60e3ea54bc211cd8afa9b0b2c.avif?t=1750182104\" width=736 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CURRENT FEATURES :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Teotihuacan\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Navigate faithfully recreated ruins, including major structures of the ancient site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong> \u2013 Experience the mystery up close through the eyes of a detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive Through the Ruins</strong> \u2013 Take the wheel of a drivable vehicle to cover vast distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn the Ropes</strong> \u2013 A guided tutorial introduces basic movement and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Early Access version contains</strong> ~1/4 of the game. Full game will add more areas, puzzles, and story content which will be released for 1.0 version.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542220/extras/9cd495cc2c93d8df909b2aa823837804.avif?t=1750182104\" width=736 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLANNED FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved character mechanics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integration of the remaining  content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passage of time mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save game system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles.</p>",
